% Any other story: a small generic Kind list (a card with its own Module 10 gets its own file).
kind(stranger, person).    kind_text(stranger, "a stranger").
kind(threat, threat).      kind_text(threat, "a threat").
kind(clue, clue).          kind_text(clue, "a clue").
kind(rumour, news).        kind_text(rumour, "a rumour").
kind(price, price).        kind_text(price, "the price of something done before").
